{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_05_beg","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_05","title":"冬靈輓歌","storyCode":"TW-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"51a9686ec51ecad579e9eb81e33af1de937923840a8e26c4476f69294dfd28a2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"落日中的街道忽然迴響起歌聲，塞弗林認為這是敵人串通的信號而展開搜捕。到底是應該阻止戰鬥展開救援，還是繼續尋找真凶，鈴蘭和亞葉此時也產生了分歧。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 5上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，整個街道都迴蕩著歌聲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"淡藍的暮色灑在蕭條的街道上，零零星星的燈火之間，有人生活。\n二人目光所及的街道上空無一人，朦朧的歌聲織成了一張網，夕陽西下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"narration","text":"裸露的源石叢，躁動的抗議者，蒼白的星空和泥磚一同陷入沉寂。\n歌聲......只剩下歌聲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事......我看見了什麼？這是......源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......民謠？還是詩歌？在日落的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德有這樣的習俗嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......亞葉姐姐，你聽得懂歌詞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不......但這是萊塔尼亞語嗎？現代的萊塔尼亞語可沒有這麼晦澀的發音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是，很好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"像是第一次在羅德島艦橋上眺望大地那樣，悠揚......古老......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......這的確是法術......和東國的某些古老技藝一樣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"把人找出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，但是找出來之後呢？直接逮捕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"會被別有用心的人當做煽動的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......是為了防止他們挑撥感染者與非感染者的關係，始作俑者說不定就是冬靈人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林長官！？這、這是要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是冬靈的歌謠，只在古老的祭典和葬禮上出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"冬靈人是挑撥感染者和非感染者矛盾，帶領那些危險分子破壞城鎮動力設施的罪魁禍首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是談寬容的時候，我認為這是某種信號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不會無端暴露自己，肯定有其他人在暗中行動，而且多半都是術師，留個心眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——冬靈人到底指什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"本地的卡普里尼，在幾百年前，他們才是這片群山的住民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......然後是沃倫姆德和冬靈人的衝突，就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不止如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"只是單純的殖民問題的話，哥倫比亞，雷姆必拓，哪個國家都有過這樣的歷史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓你們想方設法避開話題的話，會這麼簡單嗎？只是矛盾和衝突？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道我該不該告訴你們，這的確超過了羅德島有必要知道的範疇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"由一位憲兵把這些事情冠冕堂皇地告訴一家境外企業，這會讓某些貴族十分地不高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族......？不高興？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——安托為了幫你們犧牲了！現在還是講面子的時候嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞、亞葉姐姐！犧牲......不該變成我們爭吵的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林長官......！可以先停下這場搜捕嗎？這會讓大家的情緒更糟，會讓事情無法挽回的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，唯一的線索近在眼前，我們不能放過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"誒......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林，萊塔尼亞那麼多的移動城邦，那些身居高塔之巔的貴族，有誰管過你們的死活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"就算大裂谷出現，倘若最近的移動城邦傾力支援，當真會出現饑荒這種事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林，看清楚是誰在幫助你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......亞葉小姐，我比誰都清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也清楚，羅德島幫不了我們一輩子。等到事件解決，沃倫姆德重回它應有的位置時，我不希望收到來自某座高塔的信件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......請理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"但是亞葉姐姐，我們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——爆炸！？又是襲擊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"長官、長官！救救我們！我們需要幫助！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"慢點，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"他們、他們啟動了那些城防裝置！爆炸，火焰，他們——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！感染者們、感染者們抓住了所有在十二音街道巡邏的憲兵！我們失去聯絡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"他們利用那些留聲機負隅頑抗，現在整個街道已經失去控制——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":".......他們不該這麼井井有條，誰在指揮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"還不清楚——但是很多非感染者也加入了抗議的隊伍！沃倫姆德已經被......分割成兩半了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"呿，冬靈人......這下好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"包圍整條街道，控制人群，我們要把街道搶回來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳咳，咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"該死......你先回議事廳，拉響警報，現在開始不只是單純的感染者糾紛了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德進入戒嚴狀態，讓所有民兵集合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"可是如果現在我們自相殘殺，沃倫姆德肯定堅持不過這個冬天——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"照我說的做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"遵、遵命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"至於羅德島的二位......你們，你們就按照自己覺得正確的想法去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"坦白說，我們沒有空來盯著你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我要求更多的情報——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但我們應該先參與救援......很多無辜的人都被捲進來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——我們會找到兇手的，在這之後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃倫姆德一定會給羅德島一個滿意的答覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你們能信守承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我到時候還活著的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......亞葉姐姐，我們剛才應該阻止塞弗林長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有用，你也看到了，他們都很激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"是......這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果真像長官說的那樣，饑荒近在眼前，我們卻還要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......只有快點找出犯人，才能平息這場動亂，放過這條線索，會很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是那個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐，你真覺得找到那個兇手，我們就能解決問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——亞葉姐姐，冷靜一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......鈴蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐也清楚......現在大家都在氣頭上，都不太清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得......雖然只是我的感覺，但我的感覺很準的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得也許......有什麼更糟糕的事情已經開始發生了。那種，說不出對錯的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要做的，是盡可能幫助那些被捲進來的無辜鎮民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐......如果不攔著塞弗林長官的話，事情真的會變得很糟糕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（欲言又止）......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]}]}
